			"notes": "# Bigger Boats 1.0.0\n\nBigger Boats lets up to four players ride in one vanilla boat. Install it on the Fabric server for gameplay support; clients can remain unmodded, with an optional client install for cleaner seat spacing and dynamic boat stretching.\n\n## Validation\n\n- GitHub publish workflow `27429801346` completed successfully on commit `61113dbe297c96f7b132dfd1ce77d010dc519b7f`.\n- The publish gate built all supported compatibility profiles and ran client plus dedicated-server smoke tests for every supported game version.\n- Both smoke markers appeared across the matrix: `BIGGERBOATS_SMOKE_TEST_PASS` and `BIGGERBOATS_SERVER_SMOKE_TEST_PASS`.\n- The normal `build` workflow rerun `27429795249` also completed successfully.\n\n## Modrinth Uploads\n\n- `1.0.0+mc1.20-1.20.4`: `7VszMwsz`\n- `1.0.0+mc1.20.5-1.21.10`: `Wn7e3XTl`\n- `1.0.0+mc1.21.11`: `sb9snz5O`\n- `1.0.0+mc26.1-26.2-pre-3`: `7SOT3TOv`"
